/target

# No .nge key material is committed — not the real key, not a test key. The
# build reads keys/nge_master.key (or $NGE_KEY_FILE); with no key file present
# it falls back to a non-functional dev placeholder (see build.rs) so clones
# still compile. Provide a real key out-of-band to pack/open real bundles.
/keys/
